        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Reagan; Give Us Our Skeletons\n- People: Eugene Jarecki; Ronald Reagan; Paul-Anders Simma; Niillas Somby; Mons Somby\n- Topics: documentary films; presidency; Sami ancestry\n\nFacts:\n- Give Us Our Skeletons is a 1999 documentary film directed by Paul-Anders Simma.\n- Give Us Our Skeletons is titled Antakaa Meille Luurankomme in Finnish and Oaivveskaldjut in North Sami.\n- Give Us Our Skeletons follows Niillas Somby, a Sami man, as he retraces his family ancestry and searches for the head of his ancestor Mons Somby.\n- Reagan is a 2011 American documentary film written and directed by Eugene Jarecki.\n- Reagan covers the presidency of Ronald Reagan.",
